    "name": "FRED API - Federal Reserve Economic Data Categories API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Federal Reserve Economic Data (FRED) API provided by the Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis offers programmatic access to over 800,000 economic time series including reserve requirement data, monetary base measures, H.6 Money Stock Measures, and historical aggregate reserve data from the discontinued H.3 release. The API uses API key authentication and returns data in JSON, XML, or other formats.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Federal Reserve Bank of St. Louis",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
